Package: com.duoface.carplay.nativejoinprobe
Name: DuoFace Native Scene Join Probe
Version: 0.0.2~bargeometry1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Maintainer: DuoFace Independent
Depends: mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 16.0)
Section: Tweaks
Description: Isolated read-only CarPlay-owned Dashboard scene and natural native Dock diagnostic; does NOT register a DuoFace app, join iPhone app scenes or change UI. Logs scene state and validates session-bound native viewport. No SpringBoard injection; no Sileo release without further verification.
